    "Original16packet fairness, readiness/return semantics, resend invalidation, deferred interface/MAC ownership, reply recycling and logging remain. No meter or synthetic result is added.",
    "Hosts fixture remains test-only with productprefix unchanged; independent negative controls and originalfailure evidence are retained."
